{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "分段存储管理地址转换交互演示",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>body{font:sans-serif;background:#f4f6f9;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:20px}.box{background:#fff;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);width:220px;margin:0 10px}h2{color:#333;text-align:center}h3{color:#555;font-size:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}.seg{height:30px;line-height:30px;text-align:center;color:#fff;margin:4px 0;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;transition:.3s}.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}.tbl th,.tbl td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;text-align:center}.hl{background:#ffeb3b!important;transform:scale(1.05)}.err{background:#f44336!important}.btn{padding:8px 16px;margin:5px;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.b1{background:#2196f3}.b2{background:#9e9e9e}#msg{color:#d32f2f;font-weight:bold;min-height:20px;text-align:center}</style></head><body><div><h2>分段存储管理：地址转换演示</h2><div style='display:flex;align-items:flex-start'><div class='box'><h3>逻辑地址</h3><p style='text-align:center;font-size:16px'>段号: <b id='sn'>-</b><br>偏移: <b id='so'>-</b></p><div id='ls'></div></div><div class='box'><h3>段表</h3><table class='tbl'><tr><th>段号</th><th>基址</th><th>段长</th></tr><tbody id='stb'></tbody></table></div><div class='box'><h3>物理内存</h3><div id='ps'></div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:15px'><button class='btn b1' onclick='run()'>演示转换</button><button class='btn b2' onclick='reset()'>重置</button><p id='msg'>点击“演示转换”开始</p></div></div><script>const S=[{n:'主程序',b:0,l:100,c:'#4caf50'},{n:'数据段',b:150,l:50,c:'#2196f3'},{n:'栈段',b:250,l:80,c:'#ff9800'}];const C=[{s:0,o:50},{s:1,o:20},{s:2,o:90},{s:1,o:60}];let i=0;function init(){let ls='',st='',ps='';S.forEach((s,j)=>{ls+=`<div class='seg' style='background:${s.c};height:${s.l/3}px'>${s.n} (L=${s.l})</div>`;st+=`<tr id='r${j}'><td>${j}</td><td>${s.b}</td><td>${s.l}</td></tr>`;ps+=`<div class='seg' style='background:${s.c};height:${s.l/3}px;opacity:.3' id='p${j}'>${s.n}</div>`;});document.getElementById('ls').innerHTML=ls;document.getElementById('stb').innerHTML=st;document.getElementById('ps').innerHTML=ps;}function run(){if(i>=C.length){document.getElementById('msg').innerText='演示完成！';return;}let c=C[i++],s=S[c.s];document.getElementById('sn').innerText=c.s;document.getElementById('so').innerText=c.o;let r=document.getElementById('r'+c.s);r.classList.add('hl');document.getElementById('msg').innerText=`查段表：段号${c.s}，基址${s.b}，段长${s.l}`;setTimeout(()=>{if(c.o>=s.l){document.getElementById('msg').innerText=`越界中断！偏移${c.o} >= 段长${s.l}`;r.classList.add('err');}else{let pa=s.b+c.o;document.getElementById('msg').innerText=`合法！物理地址 = ${s.b} + ${c.o} = ${pa}`;let p=document.getElementById('p'+c.s);p.style.opacity='1';p.innerHTML+=`<br>PA:${pa}`;}},800);setTimeout(()=>{r.classList.remove('hl','err');},2000);}function reset(){i=0;document.getElementById('sn').innerText='-';document.getElementById('so').innerText='-';document.getElementById('msg').innerText='已重置';S.forEach((_,j)=>{document.getElementById('r'+j).className='';let p=document.getElementById('p'+j);p.style.opacity='.3';p.innerText=S[j].n;});}init();</script></body></html>",
  "description": "本动画可视化了分段存储管理中的逻辑地址到物理地址的转换过程。通过点击‘演示转换’按钮，系统会依次展示查段表、越界检查以及计算物理地址的步骤，直观呈现分段机制的工作原理及越界保护机制。",
  "knowledge_base_quote": [
    "源于教材知识库：《存储器管理》分段存储管理方式",
    "分段存储管理将用户程序按逻辑关系划分为若干段，每段有独立的名字和长度。段的逻辑地址由段号和段内地址组成。段表记录每段在内存中的起始地址和段长。"
  ],
  "subtype": "animation"
}